# MOVEMENT IV — FINALE. Presto, 2/2 (alla breve), h = 112, G minor.
# File 70: b1-40 = MOTTO (b1-8) + FIRST GROUP P (b9-40).
# Motto: the CELL hurled in 8ths by the whole orchestra in octaves, three
# times, rising Gm - Cm - D, each answered by a chord-stroke; timp roll,
# vc/cb start the pulse.  P = perpetuum-mobile theme (02-themes no.7):
# b9-16 vn1 p over pulsing bass; b17-24 the theme drops into va+vc+fg
# (+cb) with vn1 descant, cresc.; b25-32 tutti f, P in vn1+fl 8va;
# b33-36 the CELL climbs Gm-Cm-Eb-D ff; b37-39 hammer-strokes on D;
# b40 General Pause.
# Horns: hn12 in G, hn34 in Bb basso; tp in G; timp g2/d3.

