HANDOFF:
  next_bar: 41 [D] TRANSITION   key: G minor -> Bb major   2/2, h=112
  dynamics: f (entries), cresc. to ff b49, dim. to p b53-56
  At the seam: b39 tutti ff D-major stroke on beat 1 (vn1 d4-a4-f#5-d6,
  vc/cb d2, horns d4-a4 / d4-d5, tp d4-d5, timp d3); b40 = General
  Pause (all rest, fermata).  Everyone arco.
  NEXT: fugato on the P head (2 bars: CELL + rising scale): vc+cb+fg
  b41 on G (Gm|Cm), va (+cl1) b43 on C (Cm|Fm), vn2 (+ob1) b45 on Eb in
  MAJOR (Eb|Ab), vn1 (+fl1) b47 on Bb major (Bb|Eb); earlier voices hold
  chord tones; b49-52 F7 tutti (CELL on F major + hammer chords); b53-56
  F pedal pp, va starts running 8ths -> S (Mvt-II cantilena) in Bb b57.
